/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (A plasma etch chamber cut in half\054 with one wafer on its holder\054 the chuck\056 A pump empties the chamber\054 gas flows in\054 and a radio\055frequency field turns the gas into a plasma that eats away the film the pattern leaves bare\056 Only the 300 mm wafer is drawn to scale\056 The loupe shows one hole etched into the silicon\054 ten times deeper than it is wide\056)
